\begin{aligned}r'_u & =\\left\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}(u e^{v}),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}(u e^{- v}),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}(u)\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle e^{v},\\,e^{- v},\\,1\\right\\rangle \\\\ r'_v & =\\left\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial v}\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}(u e^{v}),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}(u e^{- v}),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}(u)\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle u e^{v},\\,- u e^{- v},\\,0\\right\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r'_u\\times r'_v & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\mathbf i&\\mathbf j&\\mathbf k\\\\e^{v}&e^{- v}&1\\\\u e^{v}&- u e^{- v}&0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left\\langle \\begin{vmatrix}e^{- v}&1\\\\- u e^{- v}&0\\end{vmatrix},-\\begin{vmatrix}e^{v}&1\\\\u e^{v}&0\\end{vmatrix},\\begin{vmatrix}e^{v}&e^{- v}\\\\u e^{v}&- u e^{- v}\\end{vmatrix}\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle u e^{- v},\\,u e^{v},\\,- 2 u\\right\\rangle.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =\\left\\langle 4 x - \\frac{1}{z},\\,4 y + \\frac{2}{z},\\,3 z\\right\\rangle\\big|_{x=u e^{v},\\,y=u e^{- v},\\,z=u} \\\\  & =\\left\\langle 4 \\left(u e^{v}\\right) - \\frac{1}{\\left(u\\right)},\\,4 \\left(u e^{- v}\\right) + \\frac{2}{\\left(u\\right)},\\,3 \\left(u\\right)\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left\\langle 4 u e^{v} - \\frac{1}{u},\\,4 u e^{- v} + \\frac{2}{u},\\,3 u\\right\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot (r'_u\\times r'_v) & =\\left\\langle 4 u e^{v} - \\frac{1}{u},\\,4 u e^{- v} + \\frac{2}{u},\\,3 u\\right\\rangle\\cdot \\left\\langle u e^{- v},\\,u e^{v},\\,- 2 u\\right\\rangle \\\\  & =\\left(4 u e^{v} - \\frac{1}{u}\\right)\\cdot\\left(u e^{- v}\\right)+\\left(4 u e^{- v} + \\frac{2}{u}\\right)\\cdot\\left(u e^{v}\\right)+\\left(3 u\\right)\\cdot\\left(- 2 u\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(4 u^{2} - e^{- v}\\right)+\\left(4 u^{2} + 2 e^{v}\\right)+\\left(- 6 u^{2}\\right) \\\\  & =2 u^{2} + 2 e^{v} - e^{- v}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_S F\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf S & =\\iint_D F(r(u,v))\\cdot(r'_u\\times r'_v)\\,\\mathrm{d}A \\\\  & =\\iint_D 2 u^{2} + 2 e^{v} - e^{- v}\\,\\mathrm{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556174 1080 "30 u^{3} \\sin^{2}{\\left(v \\right)} - 15 u^{3}" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556174 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556174 1083 #uuid "1b303eaa-4c9a-51ab-9670-8dd51e38698e" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556175 1080 "8 u^{3} \\sin^{2}{\\left(v \\right)} - 6 u^{3}" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556175 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556175 1083 #uuid "1f98628a-6f9a-5780-bcb7-c4159ebffbe5" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556174 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556180 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556185 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556195 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556202 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1077 "selection" 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1078 #edb/ref 17592186556180 13194139536006 17592186045443 true] [17592186556176 1079 #uuid "270a3f4d-787